OL,3,GNEWSAStates to scrap insurance need for
OL,4,Adangerous dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwners of XL bully-type dogs will no
OL,7,Flonger be legally obliged to have
OL,8,Finsurance for them, after the island's
OL,9,Fgovernment confirmed it intends to
OL,10,Fscrap the requirement.
OL,12,FIt comes after the only insurer
OL,13,Foffering the cover in Jersey resolved
OL,14,Fto stop its provision.
OL,16,FThe requirement for third party
OL,17,Fliability insurance has been in place
OL,18,Fsince December 2025 but a government
OL,19,Fspokesperson has said the process to
OL,20,Fremove it is "underway".
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
