OL,3,GNEWSAStates to scrap insurance need for
OL,4,Adangerous dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmerican bulldog owner Nina Morgan said
OL,7,Fit "takes pressure off owners" to find
OL,8,Fcover should no insurer offer it, but
OL,9,Fthey remain "utterly exposed" as risks
OL,10,Fare not confined to aggression.
